    <content>
      <![CDATA[<h2 id="一、Hexo-简介"><a href="#一、Hexo-简介" class="headerlink" title="一、Hexo 简介"></a>一、Hexo 简介</h2><p>Hexo 是一个快速、简洁且高效的静态博客框架。基于 Node.js，使用 Markdown 解析文章，通过主题生成静态页面，支持一键部署到 GitHub Pages、Vercel、Netlify 等平台。</p><p><strong>核心优势：</strong></p><ul><li>极快的生成速度，数百篇文章秒级渲染</li><li>丰富的插件生态和主题市场</li><li>原生支持 Markdown，支持 Front-matter 元数据</li><li>一条命令部署到 GitHub Pages &#x2F; Coding Pages &#x2F; 自建服务器</li><li>社区活跃，中文文档完善</li></ul><hr><h2 id="二、环境准备与安装"><a href="#二、环境准备与安装" class="headerlink" title="二、环境准备与安装"></a>二、环境准备与安装</h2><h3 id="2-1-安装-Node-js"><a href="#2-1-安装-Node-js" class="headerlink" title="2.1 安装 Node.js"></a>2.1 安装 Node.js</h3><p>Hexo 依赖 Node.js 运行时。前往 <a href="https://nodejs.org/">Node.js 官网</a> 下载 LTS 版本并安装。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">node -v   <span class="comment"># 验证 Node.js 安装，推荐 v16+</span></span><br><span class="line">npm -v    <span class="comment"># 验证 npm 安装</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-2-安装-Hexo-CLI"><a href="#2-2-安装-Hexo-CLI" class="headerlink" title="2.2 安装 Hexo CLI"></a>2.2 安装 Hexo CLI</h3><p>通过 npm 全局安装 Hexo 命令行工具：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install -g hexo-cli</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>验证安装：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo version</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="三、初始化博客项目"><a href="#三、初始化博客项目" class="headerlink" title="三、初始化博客项目"></a>三、初始化博客项目</h2><h3 id="3-1-创建项目"><a href="#3-1-创建项目" class="headerlink" title="3.1 创建项目"></a>3.1 创建项目</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo init my-blog     <span class="comment"># 创建博客目录</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cd</span> my-blog</span><br><span class="line">npm install           <span class="comment"># 安装依赖</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>初始化后会自动安装默认依赖，包括 hexo-server、hexo-generator-* 等核心插件。</p><h3 id="3-2-初次运行"><a href="#3-2-初次运行" class="headerlink" title="3.2 初次运行"></a>3.2 初次运行</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>打开浏览器访问 <code>http://localhost:4000</code>，即可看到默认的 Hello World 页面。</p><hr><h2 id="四、目录结构说明"><a href="#四、目录结构说明" class="headerlink" title="四、目录结构说明"></a>四、目录结构说明</h2><p>初始化完成后，项目结构如下：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">my-blog/</span><br><span class="line">├── _config.yml          # 站点配置文件（核心）</span><br><span class="line">├── _config.landscape.yml # 主题默认配置（如使用 landscape）</span><br><span class="line">├── node_modules/        # npm 依赖</span><br><span class="line">├── package.json         # 项目依赖声明</span><br><span class="line">├── scaffolds/           # 模板文件夹</span><br><span class="line">│   ├── draft.md         # 草稿模板</span><br><span class="line">│   ├── page.md          # 页面模板</span><br><span class="line">│   └── post.md          # 文章模板</span><br><span class="line">├── source/              # 源文件夹（所有用户内容）</span><br><span class="line">│   ├── _data/           # 数据文件（JSON/YAML），供模板使用</span><br><span class="line">│   ├── _drafts/         # 草稿文件夹</span><br><span class="line">│   ├── _posts/          # 文章文件夹（Markdown 文件放这里）</span><br><span class="line">│   └── images/          # 图片等静态资源</span><br><span class="line">├── themes/              # 主题文件夹</span><br><span class="line">│   └── landscape/       # 默认主题</span><br><span class="line">└── public/              # 生成的静态网站（hexo generate 后出现）</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><table><thead><tr><th>关键文件 &#x2F; 目录</th><th>作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>_config.yml</code></td><td><strong>站点全局配置</strong>：标题、URL、部署信息等</td></tr><tr><td><code>source/_posts/</code></td><td>存放所有博客文章（.md 文件）</td></tr><tr><td><code>themes/</code></td><td>存放主题，每个主题一个子目录</td></tr><tr><td><code>scaffolds/</code></td><td>定义新文章的默认 Front-matter 模板</td></tr><tr><td><code>public/</code></td><td>执行 <code>hexo generate</code> 后生成的静态站点</td></tr><tr><td><code>package.json</code></td><td>管理 Hexo 及插件依赖版本</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="五、创建新文章"><a href="#五、创建新文章" class="headerlink" title="五、创建新文章"></a>五、创建新文章</h2><h3 id="5-1-基本命令"><a href="#5-1-基本命令" class="headerlink" title="5.1 基本命令"></a>5.1 基本命令</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo new <span class="string">&quot;文章标题&quot;</span>           <span class="comment"># 创建新文章（默认布局 post）</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo new draft <span class="string">&quot;草稿标题&quot;</span>     <span class="comment"># 创建草稿</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo new page <span class="string">&quot;关于&quot;</span>          <span class="comment"># 创建独立页面（如「关于我」）</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>执行后会在 <code>source/_posts/</code> 下生成 <code>文章标题.md</code>。</p><h3 id="5-2-发布草稿"><a href="#5-2-发布草稿" class="headerlink" title="5.2 发布草稿"></a>5.2 发布草稿</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo publish <span class="string">&quot;草稿标题&quot;</span>       <span class="comment"># 将草稿移到 _posts 并发布</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="六、Markdown-写作格式"><a href="#六、Markdown-写作格式" class="headerlink" title="六、Markdown 写作格式"></a>六、Markdown 写作格式</h2><h3 id="6-1-Front-matter"><a href="#6-1-Front-matter" class="headerlink" title="6.1 Front-matter"></a>6.1 Front-matter</h3><p>每篇文章顶部的 YAML 格式元数据，Hexo 据此渲染分类、标签、日期等：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">文章标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">date:</span> <span class="number">2026-07-02 12:00:00</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">categories:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">技术</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">前端</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">tags:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">Hexo</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="bullet">-</span> <span class="string">博客</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">description:</span> <span class="string">文章摘要描述</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">top:</span> <span class="literal">true</span>      <span class="comment"># 置顶（需主题支持）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><table><thead><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>title</code></td><td>文章标题</td></tr><tr><td><code>date</code></td><td>创建日期，格式 <code>YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>categories</code></td><td>分类，支持多级（缩进表示层级）</td></tr><tr><td><code>tags</code></td><td>标签，一个或多个</td></tr><tr><td><code>description</code></td><td>文章摘要</td></tr><tr><td><code>top</code> &#x2F; <code>sticky</code></td><td>置顶标志（部分主题支持）</td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="6-2-标题"><a href="#6-2-标题" class="headerlink" title="6.2 标题"></a>6.2 标题</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="section"># 一级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">## 二级标题</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">### 三级标题</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-3-代码块"><a href="#6-3-代码块" class="headerlink" title="6.3 代码块"></a>6.3 代码块</h3><p>使用三个反引号包裹，并指定语言以获得语法高亮：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="code">```python</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">def hello():</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">    print(&quot;Hello, Hexo!&quot;)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="code">```</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-4-图片"><a href="#6-4-图片" class="headerlink" title="6.4 图片"></a>6.4 图片</h3><p>将图片放入 <code>source/images/</code> 目录，然后在文章中引用：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">![<span class="string">图片描述</span>](<span class="link">/images/example.png</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>也可以使用 HTML 控制大小：</p><figure class="highlight html"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;<span class="name">img</span> <span class="attr">src</span>=<span class="string">&quot;/images/example.png&quot;</span> <span class="attr">width</span>=<span class="string">&quot;300&quot;</span> <span class="attr">alt</span>=<span class="string">&quot;描述&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-5-链接"><a href="#6-5-链接" class="headerlink" title="6.5 链接"></a>6.5 链接</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">[<span class="string">链接文字</span>](<span class="link">https://example.com</span>)</span><br><span class="line">[<span class="string">站内文章</span>](<span class="link">/posts/other-article</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-6-引用与列表"><a href="#6-6-引用与列表" class="headerlink" title="6.6 引用与列表"></a>6.6 引用与列表</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="quote">&gt; 这是引用文字</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 无序列表项 1</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">-</span> 无序列表项 2</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">1.</span> 有序列表项 1</span><br><span class="line"><span class="bullet">2.</span> 有序列表项 2</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-7-表格"><a href="#6-7-表格" class="headerlink" title="6.7 表格"></a>6.7 表格</h3><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">| 列 A | 列 B | 列 C |</span><br><span class="line">|------|------|------|</span><br><span class="line">| 数据 | 数据 | 数据 |</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="6-8-文章摘要截断"><a href="#6-8-文章摘要截断" class="headerlink" title="6.8 文章摘要截断"></a>6.8 文章摘要截断</h3><p>在正文中插入 <code>&lt;!-- more --&gt;</code>，此前的内容将作为文章摘要显示在首页。</p><hr><h2 id="七、本地预览"><a href="#七、本地预览" class="headerlink" title="七、本地预览"></a>七、本地预览</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo server        <span class="comment"># 启动本地服务器，默认端口 4000</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo s -p 5000     <span class="comment"># 指定端口 5000</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo s --draft     <span class="comment"># 同时显示草稿</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo s --debug     <span class="comment"># 输出调试信息</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>启动后浏览器访问 <code>http://localhost:4000</code> 即可预览。修改文章后无需重启，刷新浏览器即可看到更新。</p><hr><h2 id="八、生成静态文件"><a href="#八、生成静态文件" class="headerlink" title="八、生成静态文件"></a>八、生成静态文件</h2><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo generate      <span class="comment"># 生成静态文件到 public/ 目录</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo g             <span class="comment"># 简写</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo g --watch     <span class="comment"># 监视文件变动并自动重新生成</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo g --debug     <span class="comment"># 输出调试信息</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>生成的静态文件存放在 <code>public/</code> 目录，可直接部署到任意静态服务器。</p><p>清理缓存后重新生成：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean         <span class="comment"># 清除缓存（db.json）和 public/</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo g             <span class="comment"># 重新生成</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="九、部署到-GitHub-Pages"><a href="#九、部署到-GitHub-Pages" class="headerlink" title="九、部署到 GitHub Pages"></a>九、部署到 GitHub Pages</h2><h3 id="9-1-安装部署插件"><a href="#9-1-安装部署插件" class="headerlink" title="9.1 安装部署插件"></a>9.1 安装部署插件</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-deployer-git --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="9-2-配置-config-yml"><a href="#9-2-配置-config-yml" class="headerlink" title="9.2 配置 _config.yml"></a>9.2 配置 <code>_config.yml</code></h3><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">deploy:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repo:</span> <span class="string">https://github.com/你的用户名/你的用户名.github.io.git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">branch:</span> <span class="string">gh-pages</span>    <span class="comment"># 或 master / main</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="9-3-执行部署"><a href="#9-3-执行部署" class="headerlink" title="9.3 执行部署"></a>9.3 执行部署</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo generate &amp;&amp; hexo deploy</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 或简写</span></span><br><span class="line">hexo g -d</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>部署完成后等待 1-2 分钟，访问 <code>https://你的用户名.github.io</code> 即可看到博客。</p><h3 id="9-4-其他部署平台"><a href="#9-4-其他部署平台" class="headerlink" title="9.4 其他部署平台"></a>9.4 其他部署平台</h3><ul><li><strong>Vercel</strong>：关联 GitHub 仓库，自动构建部署</li><li><strong>Netlify</strong>：类似 Vercel，支持一键部署</li><li><strong>自建服务器</strong>：使用 <code>hexo-deployer-rsync</code> 或 SCP 上传 <code>public/</code> 目录</li><li><strong>Coding Pages</strong>：国内访问更快，配置方式类似 GitHub Pages</li></ul><hr><h2 id="十、主题安装与配置（以-Butterfly-为例）"><a href="#十、主题安装与配置（以-Butterfly-为例）" class="headerlink" title="十、主题安装与配置（以 Butterfly 为例）"></a>十、主题安装与配置（以 Butterfly 为例）</h2><h3 id="10-1-安装-Butterfly"><a href="#10-1-安装-Butterfly" class="headerlink" title="10.1 安装 Butterfly"></a>10.1 安装 Butterfly</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 在博客根目录执行</span></span><br><span class="line">git <span class="built_in">clone</span> -b master https://github.com/jerryc127/hexo-theme-butterfly.git themes/butterfly</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="10-2-安装必要插件"><a href="#10-2-安装必要插件" class="headerlink" title="10.2 安装必要插件"></a>10.2 安装必要插件</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-renderer-pug hexo-renderer-stylus --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="10-3-启用主题"><a href="#10-3-启用主题" class="headerlink" title="10.3 启用主题"></a>10.3 启用主题</h3><p>修改根目录 <code>_config.yml</code>：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">theme:</span> <span class="string">butterfly</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="10-4-Butterfly-主要配置"><a href="#10-4-Butterfly-主要配置" class="headerlink" title="10.4 Butterfly 主要配置"></a>10.4 Butterfly 主要配置</h3><p>将主题默认配置复制到根目录：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">cp</span> themes/butterfly/_config.yml _config.butterfly.yml</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>在 <code>_config.butterfly.yml</code> 中进行自定义配置。常用配置项：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 导航菜单</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">menu:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">首页:</span> <span class="string">/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-home</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">归档:</span> <span class="string">/archives/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-archive</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">标签:</span> <span class="string">/tags/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-tags</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="string">分类:</span> <span class="string">/categories/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fas</span> <span class="string">fa-folder-open</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 社交图标</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">social:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">fab fa-github:</span> <span class="string">https://github.com/你的用户名</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">GitHub</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">fas fa-envelope:</span> <span class="string">mailto:your@email.com</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">Email</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 评论系统（以 Waline 为例）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">comments:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">use:</span> <span class="string">Waline</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="10-5-创建必要页面"><a href="#10-5-创建必要页面" class="headerlink" title="10.5 创建必要页面"></a>10.5 创建必要页面</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo new page tags</span><br><span class="line">hexo new page categories</span><br><span class="line">hexo new page about</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>分别在生成的 <code>index.md</code> 中添加：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># tags/index.md</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">&quot;tags&quot;</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># categories/index.md</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">&quot;categories&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="十一、常用插件推荐"><a href="#十一、常用插件推荐" class="headerlink" title="十一、常用插件推荐"></a>十一、常用插件推荐</h2><table><thead><tr><th>插件</th><th>功能</th><th>安装命令</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>hexo-deployer-git</code></td><td>Git 部署</td><td><code>npm i hexo-deployer-git --save</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo-generator-feed</code></td><td>生成 RSS 订阅</td><td><code>npm i hexo-generator-feed --save</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo-generator-sitemap</code></td><td>生成站点地图</td><td><code>npm i hexo-generator-sitemap --save</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo-generator-searchdb</code></td><td>本地搜索索引</td><td><code>npm i hexo-generator-searchdb --save</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo-word-counter</code></td><td>字数统计与阅读时长</td><td><code>npm i hexo-word-counter --save</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo-abbrlink</code></td><td>文章永久链接短链</td><td><code>npm i hexo-abbrlink --save</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo-filter-nofollow</code></td><td>外链添加 nofollow</td><td><code>npm i hexo-filter-nofollow --save</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo-blog-encrypt</code></td><td>文章加密阅读</td><td><code>npm i hexo-blog-encrypt --save</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo-renderer-marked</code></td><td>Markdown 渲染增强</td><td><code>npm i hexo-renderer-marked --save</code></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="推荐配置示例"><a href="#推荐配置示例" class="headerlink" title="推荐配置示例"></a>推荐配置示例</h3><p><strong>永久链接（abbrlink）：</strong></p><p>在 <code>_config.yml</code> 中：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">permalink:</span> <span class="string">posts/:abbrlink.html</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">abbrlink:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">alg:</span> <span class="string">crc32</span>   <span class="comment"># 算法：crc16 / crc32</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">rep:</span> <span class="string">hex</span>     <span class="comment"># 进制：dec / hex</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>本地搜索：</strong></p><p><code>_config.yml</code> 添加：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">search:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">path:</span> <span class="string">search.xml</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">field:</span> <span class="string">post</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">content:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><hr><h2 id="十二、常见问题与排错"><a href="#十二、常见问题与排错" class="headerlink" title="十二、常见问题与排错"></a>十二、常见问题与排错</h2><h3 id="Q1：hexo-命令找不到？"><a href="#Q1：hexo-命令找不到？" class="headerlink" title="Q1：hexo 命令找不到？"></a>Q1：<code>hexo</code> 命令找不到？</h3><p>确保全局安装成功，检查 Node.js 环境变量是否正确。可尝试使用本地安装版本：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npx hexo server</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 或直接调用</span></span><br><span class="line">./node_modules/.bin/hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Q2：端口-4000-被占用？"><a href="#Q2：端口-4000-被占用？" class="headerlink" title="Q2：端口 4000 被占用？"></a>Q2：端口 4000 被占用？</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo s -p 5000       <span class="comment"># 切换端口</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Windows 查看端口占用</span></span><br><span class="line">netstat -ano | findstr :4000</span><br><span class="line">taskkill /PID &lt;PID&gt; /F</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Linux/macOS</span></span><br><span class="line">lsof -i :4000</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">kill</span> -9 &lt;PID&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Q3：部署后页面空白-样式丢失？"><a href="#Q3：部署后页面空白-样式丢失？" class="headerlink" title="Q3：部署后页面空白 &#x2F; 样式丢失？"></a>Q3：部署后页面空白 &#x2F; 样式丢失？</h3><p>检查 <code>_config.yml</code> 中的 <code>url</code> 和 <code>root</code> 配置：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">url:</span> <span class="string">https://你的用户名.github.io</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">root:</span> <span class="string">/</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Q4：文章修改后未更新？"><a href="#Q4：文章修改后未更新？" class="headerlink" title="Q4：文章修改后未更新？"></a>Q4：文章修改后未更新？</h3><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo g</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>清除缓存后重新生成即可。</p><h3 id="Q5：主题安装后报错？"><a href="#Q5：主题安装后报错？" class="headerlink" title="Q5：主题安装后报错？"></a>Q5：主题安装后报错？</h3><p>确保安装了主题所需的渲染器插件。常见缺失：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-renderer-pug hexo-renderer-stylus --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Q6：图片无法显示？"><a href="#Q6：图片无法显示？" class="headerlink" title="Q6：图片无法显示？"></a>Q6：图片无法显示？</h3><ul><li>图片放入 <code>source/images/</code>，引用用 <code>/images/filename.png</code></li><li>也可使用图床（如 SM.MS、GitHub + jsDelivr）+ 绝对 URL</li><li>安装 <code>hexo-asset-image</code> 插件可在文章同级目录存放图片</li></ul><h3 id="Q7：如何批量迁移-WordPress-Jekyll-文章？"><a href="#Q7：如何批量迁移-WordPress-Jekyll-文章？" class="headerlink" title="Q7：如何批量迁移 WordPress &#x2F; Jekyll 文章？"></a>Q7：如何批量迁移 WordPress &#x2F; Jekyll 文章？</h3><p>Hexo 内置迁移工具：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-migrator-wordpress --save   <span class="comment"># WordPress</span></span><br><span class="line">npm install hexo-migrator-rss --save         <span class="comment"># 通用 RSS</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Q8：中文路径或文件名导致部署失败？"><a href="#Q8：中文路径或文件名导致部署失败？" class="headerlink" title="Q8：中文路径或文件名导致部署失败？"></a>Q8：中文路径或文件名导致部署失败？</h3><p>文章文件名建议使用英文 + 连字符，中文标题写在 Front-matter 的 <code>title</code> 中。</p><hr><h2 id="十三、常用命令速查"><a href="#十三、常用命令速查" class="headerlink" title="十三、常用命令速查"></a>十三、常用命令速查</h2><table><thead><tr><th>命令</th><th>简写</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>hexo init [folder]</code></td><td>—</td><td>初始化项目</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo new &quot;标题&quot;</code></td><td><code>hexo n</code></td><td>新建文章</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo new draft &quot;标题&quot;</code></td><td>—</td><td>新建草稿</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo publish &quot;标题&quot;</code></td><td>—</td><td>发布草稿</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo server</code></td><td><code>hexo s</code></td><td>启动本地服务器</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo generate</code></td><td><code>hexo g</code></td><td>生成静态文件</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo deploy</code></td><td><code>hexo d</code></td><td>部署</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo generate --deploy</code></td><td><code>hexo g -d</code></td><td>生成并部署</td></tr><tr><td><code>hexo clean</code></td><td>—</td><td>清除缓存和 public</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="十四、结语"><a href="#十四、结语" class="headerlink" title="十四、结语"></a>十四、结语</h2><p>Hexo 是一个成熟稳定的静态博客框架，从安装到上线只需几分钟。配合丰富的主题和插件，你可以打造一个高度个性化的博客。建议按以下步骤进阶：</p><ol><li>选一个喜欢的主题并深度定制</li><li>配置评论系统（Waline &#x2F; Twikoo &#x2F; Giscus）</li><li>接入统计工具（百度统计 &#x2F; Google Analytics）</li><li>开启 HTTPS 和 CDN 加速</li><li>持续写作，保持更新</li></ol><p>开始你的 Hexo 博客之旅吧！</p>]]>
